	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat050150"},
		line=1872,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I finish my blade arts training and return to my room.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I've recovered almost all of my former strength, but I'm still a far cry from how I was during Operation Bellflower.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"During our flight from the Imperial Palace, I was nothing short of a one-man army.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"As much as I want to, there's no way I could do the same thing right now.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"...I envy Mitsurugi's strength.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"The Mitsurugi in my dreams stood astride the battlefield with a heart still as stone.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"With nary an errant thought on his mind, Himi-no-Mikoto's faithful creation faced the ceaselessly encroaching tide of enemies and cut them down to the last.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Truly, he was his lord's blade.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Nothing more or less than a tool for making war, purged of every last impurity.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"His was the ideal image of a warrior, the personification of “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"What must I do to become more like him?",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Morning, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"Akari is waiting for me in front of my room.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How're you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good enough to match an average warrior. But still nowhere close to Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No change today, either?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I nod in response.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, I've got an idea. Can we borrow your room for a bit?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So, what was this idea of yours?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I have a serious request to ask of you.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Akari declares with the stern look of someone who's already made up their mind.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If my lord wishes it, I'll do anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Great.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"An awkward smile on her face, Akari takes a deep breath before declaring with determination.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, take me in your arms.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got it.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I approach Akari, pull her in by the shoulders, and hold her close to my chest.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wh-What─just like that?!”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You asked me, so I'm doing it.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's not what I meant!”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Akari throws my arms off her and glares at me with burning cheeks.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I meant it in a different sort of way!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A different way?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You know, um... L-Like taking me to bed, and putting your thing in m-my...”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait─what am I doing explaining all this?! You totally get what I mean!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not you, too...”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"I can't believe both she and Kotone would come up with the exact same idea.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"And as soon as they made up their minds, any other thoughts went straight out the window.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"I know it's rude to laugh, but I can't help the corners of my mouth from turning up.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's that supposed to mean, 'you too'?”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I do all I can to hold my facial muscles in check.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nothing. Anyway, what do you mean to accomplish by becoming intimate?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It was the Founding Empress who created Mitsurugi, and right now, she's inside me.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So I was thinking that maybe you'd be able to draw out her power if you took me to bed.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you have any proof?”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No. But it doesn't cost anything to try, right?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course it does. It'd come at the cost of your chastity.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What I do with that is none of your business. Don't look down on my resolve!”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Republic might find us at any minute! We need to be trying everything we can!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Her amaranthine eyes stare straight into mine.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"She's not going to back down, no matter what.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, I won't take you to bed.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why not? What are you hesitating for?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It doesn't cost ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"you",
{"/font"},
" anything either way. So what's holding you back?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"She's right. I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" hesitating, even in the face of my lord's orders.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"If Akari really does have Himi-no-Mikoto inside her, then perhaps laying with her just might awaken Mitsurugi's power.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"If there's even the faintest glimmer of a possibility, it ought to be worth trying.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"And yet, I simply can't accept it.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Unable to express it in words, this mysterious emotion swelling up inside me nonetheless holds me back.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"She's right. It ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"wouldn't",
{"/font"},
" cost me anything either way.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"Everything she says is completely right.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"But still, I refuse to accept it.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Even if it's to reclaim Mitsurugi's power, engaging in intimate relations with Akari is a line I mustn't cross.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"All logic points to only one conclusion, but my heart refuses to listen to reason... What is it that leads me astray?",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"How shameful it is, for a warrior to be moved by the whims of his emotions.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"All the time I spent alongside Akari and Hotori, Kanami and Elsa, and now Kotone─ has it changed me?",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As a mere vassal, I cannot lay with my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A warrior is his lord's blade. Nothing but a tool. Aren't you the one always saying that?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're a tool, then do as I say.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Unable to say anything, I purse my lips in a tight line.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see how it is. You just want to remain faithful, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi and the Founding Empress loved each other.\nThat's why you won't take me to bed.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"I try my best to not let the shock rattling inside my chest reach my face.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"I never told Akari about Mitsurugi and Himi-no-Mikoto's relationship.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Yet, Akari still saw right through me.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Is this her woman's intuition at work?",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Answer me, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Both Mitsurugi and I are our lords' blades. We know nothing of love.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look me in the eyes.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I do as I'm told and meet her gaze.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I knew it... You really do love the Founding Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I told you─",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"I know nothing of love.",
{"/font"},
"”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If I were the Founding Empress instead... you'd gladly make love to me, wouldn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Right as I'm about to raise my voice, a commotion reaches our ears from outside.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...What's going on?”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Whatever it is, it doesn't sound good.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"As soon we rush outside, we spot a crowd of people gathering on the outskirts of the shrine grounds.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"It looks like the priests are working together to keep someone restrained.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Why, Tokita-sama, Miyaguni-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We have just now apprehended a trespasser.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Her declaration causes me to tense up all at once.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it a Republican scout?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Not quite. In fact, she claims to be a warrior...”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Intruder"},
			{
"“Please, let me go! We're running out of time!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"A familiar voice rings out from the throng of priests.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Could it be─",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu?! Koyuzu, is that you?!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ah, Tokita-sama! Indeed it is me, Ina Koyuzu!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let her go. She's on our side.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Oh my, is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"At Isuzu's order, the priests release Koyuzu.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"She's wearing her familiar infiltrator's garb, but her entire body is drenched with blood and sweat.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"In her usual condition, she'd never allow herself to be captured like this.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"She must have exhausted herself just making it this far.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... At last, we meet again...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad you're still alive.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“My fleetness of foot... is all I can be proud of...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What of our comrades in Tenkyo?”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Sarashina-sama and Maki-sama are both alive and well.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama... was captured by the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“She has yet to be executed... but I fear it is only a matter of time...”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Koyuzu whimpers, hanging her head.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Please pardon me for interrupting, but I must inquire.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“How did you come to know the location of Inner Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“This place should be concealed by formidable magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“That's right! I almost forgot the most important part!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Koyuzu gulps down the water brought by a nearby priest, taking a few breaths to steady her breathing.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Three days prior, the Republican Army began marching in this direction.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“An entire brigade of elite shock troops numbering at least three thousand strong.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“At their rate of advance, they will arrive here by nightfall tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Inner Iseya's been exposed?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“No... It cannot be...”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I was only able to glean knowledge of this place by eavesdropping on their officers' transmissions.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I cannot say how, but they have identified this precise location as their objective.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So you ran ahead to give us warning.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes. I knew you would be in grave danger otherwise, so I-I...”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"Koyuzu's staggers on her feet and nearly falls over.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"I quickly reach out to catch her in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you, Koyuzu. Get some rest.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I will fight alongside you.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And to do that, you need to rest first.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I beg... your leave...”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isuzu, see to her care.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“I have already made arrangements.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Isuzu waves her hand, and a squad of priestesses rush up carrying a stretcher.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"They pick up Koyuzu and carry her away.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Inner Iseya is to go on high alert at once.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Make preparations at once to activate the Guardian Barrier!”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"Isuzu rattles off her orders to the nearby priests and priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"At once, Inner Iseya descends into a flurry of activity.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's go find Kotone. We need to discuss our plan of action.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"We hastily assemble a war conference in the main hall.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Are we certain that the Republican Army is coming for us?”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, there's no doubt about it.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"Though Koyuzu is still young, her abilities of reconnaissance are unrivaled by any other warrior.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Our only two options are to run or to fight. I want to hear what you all think.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Let us fight.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even if we were to escape, there would be nowhere to hide that is as safe as Inner Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'd be dragging the priests and priestesses here into our fight.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“All of us are of one mind to fight.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We three hundred fifty faithful servants of Oomikami are all prepared to return to His side. You needn't question our resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Isuzu's firm declaration leaves no room for doubt.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"To prove her point, the rows of priests and priestesses arrayed behind her all nod in unison.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've mentioned that Inner Iseya has a defensive Artifact capable of resisting invaders, but what exactly can it do?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“You may think of it as a mighty cannon capable of attacking both ground and air.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It was designed to neutralize even a warrior revolt, so its firepower is immense indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“It may not be capable of destroying the entirety of the Republican Army, but it should be more than a match for a mere three thousand enemies.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Isuzu declares with absolute confidence.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even still, the enemy outnumbers us nearly ten to one. The most prudent strategy would be to let them come to us.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What do you think, Akari?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Every last pair of eyes turns to Akari, awaiting her judgment.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let us fight.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I beg you, everyone─please lend me your strength.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Akari silently lowers her head.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Humbled by her display of sincerity, the hall swells with determined resolution.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You may count on us, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Let us proceed with activating the Guardian Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Isuzu stands and begins immediately issuing orders.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isuzu, let me help with the activation.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Absolutely not. You're forbidden from using any more magic, remember?”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But then whatever am I meant to do?”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“How about you just take a seat right here?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Isuzu's right. You should stay put for the time being.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Mrrgh... It is simply cruel for me to be the only one left out.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're counting on you when the time comes.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So just leave it to us to handle things for now, okay?”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“...I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"When Akari puts it like that, Kotone is helpless but to nod her head.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What was that?!”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Long-Faced Priestess"},
			{
"“The southeast perimeter has made contact with the enemy.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're here already?”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“What happened to tomorrow night?!”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Isuzu, what's the status on the Guardian Barrier?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“We have yet to activate it. Our preparations will take two more hours at the least.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Two hours... No, we will make haste and get it done within the hour.”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Isuzu"},
			{
"“Until then, please defend the Chancel Shrine.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, we'll go and buy you some time.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, Soujin-sama! One moment, if you please!”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"Kotone scampers off towards a storeroom and returns with an object cradled in her arms.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Haah, haah... Please, take this with you.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"The long, slender package in her arms could only be one thing─",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I pull the cloth aside to reveal a gleaming spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't this...?”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I recognize its blue-white hue at once.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Hatsushimo, a spellblade I could never forget.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though this may be the spellblade that manipulated Hotori-sama, it still contains the souls of devoted priestesses all the same.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I could not bear to dispose of it, and so, I re-Honed it.”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have taken measures to ensure its safety, so I pray that it might serve you well.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I was unable to restore its brumal magicks, but it should still be of much finer quality than the spellblade you currently use.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thanks. I couldn't have asked for anything better.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"I'd lost the spellblade I always used during our flight from Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Up until now, I'd been using an inscriptionless blade stored in Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Even without its enchantment of frost, Hatsushimo should prove much more reliable.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well then, Soujin, shall we?”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"As soon as we step outside, we're met with panicked priestesses running about every which way.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Look, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Akari points up towards the sky.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Following her gaze, my eyes land upon five black dots─five helicopters closing in on our position.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They're coming from above...”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"As soon as I murmur in dismay, the lead helicopter in the formation explodes─",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Impaled by what looks to be an arrow of light.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"No, an arrow of magicks.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"The helicopters behind it immediately take evasive maneuvers, but their fate is that of flies caught in a spider's web.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"One after another, blinding missiles of magicks arc up behind us and find their purchase in the enemy aircraft.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"We whirl around to find three priests greeting us with toothy grins.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"Though the nervousness still shows through on their faces, theirs are good smiles.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So it begins.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Akari's hands are trembling at her side.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is hardly your first battle. Is now any time to be trembling?”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Almost every night since we've come to Inner Iseya, my dreams have been filled with nothing but battles.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Every time, we're fighting the Republican Army in some unfamiliar place.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And one after another, our comrades in the Sworn Blades would get shot as they protect me, as they help me escape.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Their corpses just keep on piling up, higher and higher...”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Akari trails off, turning towards the sky.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"For any decent person, the thought of their comrades dying ought to be far more painful than the thought of their own death.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Even for warriors, aware of our own mortality from the moment we are born, this holds true.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"It must be all the more painful for someone like Akari.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know we have no choice but to fight.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But because of that, there will be blood.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll never stop wondering if there could've been another way─if there was anything else I could've done.”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"─If only I'd defeated the enemy the slightest bit sooner, if only I'd pulled back the slightest bit quicker, if only I'd been the slightest bit braver...",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"The slightest of differences is all that separates life from death on the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"And those of us that remain will never be free from our regrets. Not for as long as we live.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"I hesitate, wondering if it's all right to hold my lord's hand.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"What does it matter?",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"I take her hand in my own.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am but a mere vassal. To shoulder my lord's burdens is beyond my station.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah. I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I at least want to tell you this.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have not once regretted coming to serve you.”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not even after our defeat in Tenkyo.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Akari squeezes my hand back, ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm all right now.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“As your lord, I'll see this through to the end.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No matter what the outcome of this battle may be.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's what makes you my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"I smile, turning to survey the terrain of Inner Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Inner Iseya is a long, narrow settlement running north to south, flanked by steep mountains on both sides.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"At the very north end of the solitary road running through the settlement lies the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"From the top of its steps, the highest point in Inner Iseya, the Republican Army invading from the south lies in full view.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"The narrow choke point of the mountain valley forces the enemy formation to stretch out behind itself, depriving them of their advantage in numbers.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"On top of that, the impassable mountain terrain on both our flanks prevents us from being surrounded.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"There truly may not be a more defensible position in all the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's buy Isuzu some time to activate that Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"The enemy before us: an entire Republican brigade.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"A worthy foe.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go!”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"As one, the two of us leap into battle.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"We fall upon the enemy as they advance along the narrow mountain path.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"Not hesitating for a moment, we cut them down where they stand.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"In a way, fighting enemy infantry is the simplest thing in the world.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Move swiftly, faster than the enemy can see. Strike deftly, before the enemy can react.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"The key is to keep it up for long enough.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fuh!”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"The battlefield is my stage.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"My blood boils at the return of this welcome sensation.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, you all right?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course!”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Akari's more than capable of taking care of herself.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"After surviving the battle of the Imperial Palace, she is no stranger to combat.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"All around us, Inner Iseya's magicker units meet the Republican Army in pitched battle.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"The vanguard presses the attack with arrows of ice and fire, and the rear guard defends them from harm with Spellshields.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"Though they put up a strong resistance, they slowly suffer more and more casualties.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"The Republican soldiers are well-trained, and above all, possess overwhelming strength in numbers.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			{
"Concentrated bursts of bullets shatter Spellshields and reduce our allies to lifeless heaps of flesh.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"It's clear that our situation is worsening with each passing second.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gather your wounded and fall back!”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			{
"I rush into the fray, drawing the enemy's attention and creating space for our allies to retreat.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"No matter what, we have to buy time until the Guardian Barrier can be activated.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			{
"Thirty minutes have elapsed since the battle began.",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"But the enemy seems to be pulling back.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"Looks like we've defended against their assault. For now.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, are you injured?”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nope. See for yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			{
"True to her word, there's not a single scratch on her.",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You've learned yourself some nice moves.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I never expected you to compliment me on my bladesmanship.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"Akari flashes me a mischievous grin.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If only this were the last of them.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As if it'd ever be that easy.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"The moment the words leave my lips, the low droning of a\nhelicopter's rotors reaches my ears.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Another chopper...”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's leave it to the priests in the Chancel Shrine.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			{
"Before she even finishes her sentence, several arrows of light streak across the sky.",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"This helicopter is sure to be sundered once they find their mark─",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"But the explosion we wait for never comes.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			{
"Instead, the missiles glance harmlessly off an invisible Spellshield.",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			{
"It seems the Republican Army has a powerful magicker on their side.",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			{
"We can't afford to let our guard down.",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Take cover!”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			{
"I grab Akari and dive behind a nearby boulder.",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"The withering firepower bearing down on us is of a completely different caliber compared to an infantryman's rifle.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"It instantly shreds apart Spellshields and anyone unfortunate enough to be standing behind them.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stay put right here.”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			{
"Hatsushimo in hand, I leap with all my might─",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"And plunge my blade into the side of the helicopter.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"Buffeted by the blast wave, I tumble back to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That should be that.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, nicely done!”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, never mind. There's a lot more where that came from.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			{
"The Republican Army's onslaught is unending.",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			{
"But I'll cut them down as many times as it takes.",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's see what they've got.”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah!”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			{
"With Akari at my side, we cleave our way into the enemy lines once more.",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"Sallying across the battlefield, amidst the hail of bullets, the two of us leave a trail of fallen enemies in our wake.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"At some point, Akari stopped being an object to protect and became a comrade to fight alongside.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"Though her bladesmanship pales in comparison to that of a warrior, her presence of mind on the battlefield is second to none.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"Compared to most warriors, she is always looking several steps ahead.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"Safe in the knowledge that she's watching my back, I can afford to focus all of my attention on the enemy before me.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Hers is a rare talent indeed.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You alright? Think you can still keep it up?”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can do this all day.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Never before have I felt more alive than in this moment.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			{
"I could easily fight for several more hours, but our allies are beginning to reach their breaking point.",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We're taking a lot of casualties.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's fall back to the Chancel Shrine and regroup our defenses there.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"Akari and I push back the endless onslaught of enemies as we make a fighting retreat towards the Chancel Shrine.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			{
"Though we've put up a valiant fight, our numbers have been reduced to less than a hundred.",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"By comparison, the Republican Army still easily has at least twenty-five hundred combat-capable troops.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“This isn't looking good.”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've been fighting for forty minutes already... Just need to hold out for twenty more.”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And what if this Guardian Barrier isn't all it's cracked up to be?”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then Kotone and Isuzu'll have a few good smacks coming their way in the future.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			{
"We've established a defensive perimeter at the base of the Chancel Shrine, but from the enemy's perspective, we're well and truly cornered.",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"There's no escape for us now.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"Just how long will we be able to hold out for?",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is that...?”",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"The hot blood coursing through my veins instantly turns to ice.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			{
"A lone man dispassionately makes his way up the winding mountain road.",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			{
"His is a wraithlike presence, one that neither life nor death holds any sway over.",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"Even the spellblade shimmering faintly at his hip,  ",
{"ruby", text="Sandalwood"},
"Hyakutan,",
{"/ruby"},
" appears more possessed with the breath of life than its master.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono...”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			{
"He projects a wholly different aura than any enemy we've faced up until now.",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			{
"We're unable to peel our eyes away for even a second.",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll have to stop him.”",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			{
"My opponent is the master who taught me all I know.",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			{
"Unless I am fully prepared to exchange my life for his, I stand no chance of defeating Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			{
"Steeling my resolve, I turn to face him.",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			{
"Leaving Akari behind, I move to block his path along the road.",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono advances with slow, placid footsteps, wholly unsuited for the battlefield.",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"He appears to be all alone, with none of his allies anywhere to be found.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you Kokuan-dono?”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			{
"No response.",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			{
"His hollow eyes, two orbs of unfeeling glass, stare back at me.",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“I am under orders to eliminate the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“I take thee to be among their ranks.”",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What did you do with Hotori?”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			{
"Still no response.",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"I must cast aside my emotions.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			{
"This man before me is not Kokuan-dono, but another enemy to defeat.",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I cannot allow you to proceed any further.”",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Then my blade shall make way.”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			{
"A stance as indomitable as a great mountain, as flowing as a silent spring.",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			{
"No different from the Kokuan-dono of the past.",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"If anything, his presence is even more overpowering compared to before.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			{
"Did losing his memory only serve to bring him even closer to the realm of “heart and blade in concord”?",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I shall be your opponent.”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			{
"I ready Hatsushimo.",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin, of the Myougikan.”",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“I have no name.”",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono's blade has not a trace of intent behind it.",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			{
"All that fills my chest is the dreadful premonition that no matter how I strike, my blade will fail to find its mark.",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Raaaaaaarrggh!”",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			{
"Cheap tricks are meaningless against one of his skill.",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			{
"I put all I have into my strike, but Kokuan-dono effortlessly turns it aside with his own blade.",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"In a warrior's duel, attacks are not meant to be blocked head-on.",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"Battles are instead decided by reading your opponent's blade, evading their attack, and delivering a lethal counterstrike.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			name={"name", name="Kokuan"},
			{
"“Is that all?”",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"All at once, Kokuan-dono delivers a blinding response.",
			},
		},
		[397]={
			{
"A forward thrust, followed by a slash meant to sever my wrist, and a reverse-sweep across my chest.",
			},
		},
		[398]={
			{
"One deadly strike flowing straight into the next.",
			},
		},
		[399]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kgh!”",
			},
		},
		[400]={
			{
"An attack I thought I dodged slices open my ear.",
			},
		},
		[401]={
			{
"...His blade is far too fast to read.",
			},
		},
		[402]={
			{
"Is this what true mastery looks like?",
			},
		},
		[403]={
			{
