			},
		},
		[404]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What gives, Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[405]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're supposed to be my blade! The strongest blade in the world! A blade that never yields to anyone!”",
			},
		},
		[406]={
			{
"Ah, of course.",
			},
